(guidance-table)
*title Guidance table
*atmos standard
*earth spherical gm=0 omega=0
*trajectory 1 vehicle start on 1
  *initial geodetic alt=20000 long=0 lat=0 vel=1000 gama=0 psi=90 time=0 mass=10
  *file guidance.dat time tseg alpha pitchgd yawgd
  *segment 1 maneuver
    *integ dtprnt=0.25 dt=0.3
    *fly alpha vrs tseg interp-2
      0.0 0.0
      5.0 1.0
      10.0 2.0
      5.0 3.0
      0.0 4.0
    *fly betae=0
    *fly bankgd=0
    *when tseg=4 stop
*end
